sentences.text:
7. This Court has considered following aspects:
(a) investigation is over and charge-sheet is filed;
(b) though the alleged offence is under Section 376 of the Indian Penal Code and for Protection of Children from Sexual Offences Act, the victim is 16 years, 10 months and 9 days as coming out from the papers of investigation at the time of incident.

The applicant is ordered to be released on regular bail in connection with FIR being 11209017220955 of 2022 registered with Himatnagar (Rural) Police Station, Sabarkantha on his executing a personal bond of Rs.15,000/- (Rupees Fifteen Thousand only) with one surety of the like amount to the satisfaction of the trial Court and subject to the conditions that he shall;
Jigarsinh Rajusinh Parmar vs State Of Gujarat on 20 February, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/45971804/
2 [a] not take undue advantage of liberty or misuse liberty;
[b] not act in a manner injurious to the interest of the prosecution;
[c] surrender passport, if any, to the lower court within a week;
[d] not leave the India without prior permission of the R/CR.MA/3839/2023 ORDER DATED:
20/02/2023 concerned trial court;
[e] mark presence before the concerned Police Station between 1st to 10th day of every English calendar month for a period of six months between 11:00 a.m. and 2:00 p.m.;
[f] furnish the present address of residence to the Investigating Officer and also to the Court at the time of execution of the bond and shall not change the residence without prior permission of the concerned trial court;
[g] not to enter the jurisdiction limit of Himatnagar till the deposition of the victim is recorded by the trial Court;
10.

